8) De acuerdo con la Ley 1090 de 2006 y Ley 53 de 1977, la información podrá ser compartida en casos judiciales o de riesgo inminente.','f',NULL,'2',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-26 05:42:24.045471+00',NULL,NULL),('b120ac2c-b2d1-4d8c-bf45-d023d895217a','c4a8e2b1-6d3f-4a70-8e15-9f0b2c3d4e5f','28632cfa-cdd1-4762-bc42-24e367ba5c5d','c3561d3f-f207-4541-80b8-a323dce70f90','text','Otra barrera en sector Salud','f',NULL,'5',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('b15d3d4f-5f5e-4eb6-8c19-f8c766e04ce0','c4a8e2b1-6d3f-4a70-8e15-9f0b2c3d4e5f','e742200a-4bc9-4241-b552-31e4666b72b1','2bda4735-3927-4634-a666-c7f97949be0a','multiple','Acciones institucionales completadas','t','identEntidades.{_entryIndex}.obligaciones','9',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('b1677fc2-0dfb-4199-8edb-05742a986ad0','f132614c-bd11-4871-9b3d-5a85bfab9abd','3c3fd1f4-af3f-441b-9a67-a8ef8029efa4',NULL,'text','Sector Salud: ¿Acudió?','f',NULL,'3',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('b1780496-a3a1-4b24-8514-8feba07ba2cd','0a24ab30-3cfc-4861-b74d-65d21524bc00','0f5bbfb1-474c-4260-b87e-251bc3c1eb32',NULL,'boolean','¿El agresor consume drogas?','t',NULL,'13',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('b1c00110-0709-43f8-8dc4-a62d12e900f9','c4a8e2b1-6d3f-4a70-8e15-9f0b2c3d4e5f','28632cfa-cdd1-4762-bc42-24e367ba5c5d','c69a3952-ac2f-4134-9343-c946be8867a5','single','Gestión de la barrera por parte de Salvia','f',NULL,'4',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('b1ccaf47-71b5-47fb-b2cd-04f285a9be0d','c4a8e2b1-6d3f-4a70-8e15-9f0b2c3d4e5f','c9d66717-fb8c-49e8-847d-4c5e1f880a2a',NULL,'text','Describa los ajustes que realiza al plan de acción de Salvia','t',NULL,'13',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('b1f1e669-24e7-40d6-ad7c-d3f8a2ee0459','c4a8e2b1-6d3f-4a70-8e15-9f0b2c3d4e5f','e742200a-4bc9-4241-b552-31e4666b72b1','52387e43-9d64-412d-83b5-b2b6cbbf02c8','single','Sector en el que se presentó la barrera','t',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('b200cac7-3611-44f6-9a4a-d8871ffcd216','439b57e6-07ea-4da4-9721-8ed28c6ca43f','4b6c8eb6-724f-490f-9eab-934138b10dd4',NULL,'text','Compromisos','t',NULL,